# =====================================================
# Server
# =====================================================
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development

# =====================================================
# Database (Aiven / PlanetScale / local MySQL)
# =====================================================
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=4000
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=999999999
DB_NAME=stadiecon

# Set to "true" only for cloud MySQL that requires SSL
# (Aiven requires SSL; local MySQL does not)
DB_SSL=false

# =====================================================
# Auth
# =====================================================
JWT_SECRET=thisistheprojectfortheteachrunhackerthon2026
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# =====================================================
# CORS — comma-separated list of allowed origins
# Local:      http://localhost:5173
# Production: https://stadiecon.vercel.app,https://www.stadiecon.com
# =====================================================
CLIENT_ORIGIN=

Install TiDB Cloud CLI

curl -fsSL https://github.com/tidbcloud/ti-cli/releases/latest/download/install.sh | sh
2. This mount token is shown only once. Copy the command below and save it somewhere secure.

Mount Your File System

mkdir ~/tidbcloudfs && export PATH="$HOME/.ti/bin:$PATH" && export TI_FS_TOKEN="drive9_" && ti fs mount-file-system --mount-path ~/tidbcloudfs --region aws-ap-southeast-1
3. Now you can get started using it!

Start Using It

ls ~/tidbcloudfs